+///                                    * 0: Event is not used for wakeup
+///                                    * All wakeup events are by default disabled.
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 16 EVENT_POL                 0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Wakeup event Polarity.
+///                                    * 1: Event trigger when the signal is 0
+///                                    * 0: Event trigger whtn the signals is 1
